 <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">Proposition 2.16</span>, <a href="/bibliography/Orlov-K3">Orlov-K3</a>]</span>; the fact that we do not need to assume vanishing of $\mathop{\mathrm{Ext}}\nolimits ^ q(N, X)$ for $q > 0$ in the definition of negative objects above is due to <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/Canonaco-Stellari">Canonaco-Stellari</a>]</span>. 